# Reproducible Ubuntu VMs on macOS with OrbStack, cloud-init and Tailscale

I wanted three small Linux boxes on my Mac, each with one job, that I could rebuild from a file in about a minute and reach from anywhere. A homelab front door, a box for an autonomous agent, and a dev box that configures itself from my dotfiles. This is how I set them up with OrbStack, cloud-init and Tailscale, including the two things that tripped me up along the way.

